{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09458","headline":"鹧鸪啼 · 韦应物","name":"鹧鸪啼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜鹧鸪飞，飞向树南枝。\n南枝日照暖，北枝霜露滋。\n露滋不堪栖，使我夜常啼。\n愿逢云中鹤，衔我向寥廓。\n愿作城上乌，一年生九雏。\n何不旧巢住，枝弱不得去。\n何意道苦辛，客子常畏人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}